# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# The repo tracks the project + its tests. Only local, generated, and
# assistant-tooling files are ignored.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# Virtualenvs
.venv/
**/.venv/

# Python caches / build artifacts
**/__pycache__/
**/*.py[cod]
**/*.egg-info/
.eggs/
/build/
/dist/

# Tool caches
**/.pytest_cache/
**/.ruff_cache/
**/.mypy_cache/
.coverage
htmlcov/

# Assistant / coding-agent tooling files — not part of the project.
# (The orion scanning agent's own CODE under graphrag/orion/ is kept; only the
#  assistant-instruction and client-config files are ignored.)
.claude/
**/CLAUDE.md
.mcp.json

# Spec-kit tooling scaffolding (the specs/ content itself is kept)
.specify/

# Amber per-project research workspaces (local run state)
.amber-research/

# OS / editor junk
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.swp
